CP['log:money']=staff=>`${staff?`<button class="btn w" data-a="payNew" style="margin-bottom:12px">${ic('rupee')}Payment received</button>`:''}${st('Payments')}<div class="list">${D.vch.filter(v=>v.co==='log'&&v.ty==='Receipt'&&(!staff||v.by===S.me)).map(vRow).join('')||empty('None yet')}</div><div class="card"><b>Rules</b><div class="sm mut" style="margin-top:4px">Pay after pickup: send UPI QR or Razorpay link. Razorpay updates by itself; UPI needs a screenshot and Snehal Z's check. Not paid → reminders → CSE calls → shipment on hold → called back. RTO = double charge, wallet can go negative.</div></div><div class="card"><b>Incentives</b><div class="sm mut" style="margin-top:4px">CSE: ₹200 for 5 orders in a day, paid next day after pickup (cancelled don't count). Ops: pickup % — below 75% nothing, 75% → ₹150, 100% → ₹200, split between Mohin & Om Adsul.</div></div>`;
